<title>POLAND: All Polish min T-bill prices rise at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish min T-bill prices rise at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills rose at Monday's primary auction on total demand of 3.1 billion zlotys against a 600 million zloty offer, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p>			 8-week  13-week  26-week  39-week  52-week</p>
<p>   new min price   97.17    95.41    91.07     --	 83.53</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)  (97.11)    --     (90.93)    --     (83.35)</p>
<p>   new max price   97.21    95.63    91.14     --	 83.64</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)  (97.13)    --     (91.02)    --     (83.50)</p>
<p>   offer	     100.0    100.0    100.0     --	 300.0</p>
<p>   bids recorded   639.4    631.2    463.9     --     1,366.6</p>
<p>   bids accepted   100.0    100.0    100.0     --	 300.0</p>
<p>   next auction     --	150.0    100.0     --	 450.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Offer and all bids in million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
